<title>USA: PaineWebber mulls $720 mln Mass. bond refunding.</title>
<headline>PaineWebber mulls $720 mln Mass. bond refunding.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc is deciding whether to price a $720 million Massachusetts bond refunding issue Wednesday, a firm official said.</p>
<p>The official said a decision will be made in about an hour.</p>
<p>--Steven Dickson, 212-859-1652</p>
</text>
